      "id": "0d3c1448a41e-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "What is X in the sequence 24, X, 12, 18, 36, 90?",
      "questionHtml": "<!-- x-tinymce/html -->\n<p>What is X in the sequence</p>\n\n<p>24, X, 12, 18, 36, 90?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "18",
          "html": "18"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "12",
          "html": "12"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "9",
          "html": "9"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The Correct answer is Option 2</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Key Points</u></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>The pattern is:</p>\n\n<p>24 &times; 0.5 = 12</p>\n\n<p>12 &times; 1 = 12 (X)</p>\n\n<p>12 &times; 1.5 = 18</p>\n\n<p>18 &times; 2 = 36</p>\n\n<p>36 &times; 2.5 = 90</p>\n\n<p>It appears that the multiplier is increasing by 0.5 each time. So, the missing term is 12</p>\n\n<p>Hence Correct answer is Option 2.&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png"
      ],
